METHOD:: worlds
What each listener received, as Events.
METHOD:: reference
METHOD:: listeners
METHOD:: sampleRate
METHOD:: binHz
METHOD:: nyquist
METHOD:: minHz
METHOD:: rangeDb
METHOD:: panelGap

EXAMPLES::
code::
p = Platform.resourceDir +/+ "sounds/a11wlk01.wav";
PltUmwelt.fromSoundFile(p).front;

(
PltUmwelt.fromSoundFile(p, [
	(type: \fft, size: 2048),
	(type: \fft, size: 128),
	(type: \mel, bands: 20, coeffs: 5),
	(type: \band, lo: 300, hi: 3400, name: "telephone")
]).front;
)
::
